@host = http://localhost:5083
@token = <paste access token>

### Register volunteer
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "volunteer@example.com",
  "phone": "+79990000000",
  "password": "Str0ng#Password",
  "role": "Volunteer"
}

### Login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "volunteer@example.com",
  "password": "Str0ng#Password"
}

### Catalog sorted by distance
GET {{host}}/api/v1/events?sortBy=Distance&userLat=55.7558&userLon=37.6173&page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### My applications
GET {{host}}/api/v1/applications/my
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Volunteer profile
GET {{host}}/api/v1/volunteer/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
